 and turns, surprises and secrets, arcades and TV's, posters and zines. It\u2019s easy to get lost and distracted while looking for the right record - just don\u2019t forget the clients, eh?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769240/extras/507dbcafd98e79d4d29cfe063a85ee05.webp?t=1752570959\" width=16 height=16 /></span> <strong>Becoming a Wax Head also means:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovingly handcrafted, immersive musical world with cozy-punk vibes.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotional, uplifting narrative about community, mystery and the underdog spirit!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming puzzle design, mini games\u2026and Tamagotchis! \ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punchy, humorous and affectionate dialogue, set to a killer original soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gorgeous comic book art style including 50+ hand-drawn records and customers.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769240/extras/218ce2a8d563dca6e8f6e0eb8cc974c6.poster.avif?t=1752570959\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769240/extras/218ce2a8d563dca6e8f6e0eb8cc974c6.webp?t=1752570959\" class=\"bb_img\" width=601 height=284 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the Developer:</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patattie Games is the two-person indie punk duo made up of developers; creative doodler <strong>Murray Somerwolff</strong> (<i>Welcome to Elk, Spitkiss, Dead Pets Unleashed</i>) and creative programmer <strong>Rothio Tome</strong> (<i>Former UNITY developer support engineer and top Spanish GameDev streamer</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Wax Heads is a cozy-punk narrative sim about managing a struggling record store. Chat to quirky customers with unique tastes, explore a handcrafted record collection, fall in love with bands (and their drama!), or just slack off with your colleagues - whatever gets everyone\u2019s groove back!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201c...It\u2019s heartwarming to see a game that highlights the joy of musical discovery that\u2019s waiting in your local record store.\u201d<br>The Guardian<br><br>\u201cOne thing you\u2019ll notice about Wax Heads immediately, other than the vibrant, quirky art style, is that it pays homage to music stereotypes in a familiar way...\u201d<br>The Gamer<br><br>\u201cCrucially, we also fell head-over-heels for Repeater Records\u2019 punk charm, eclectic clientele, and banging jukebox. Finding the right vinyl is deeply satisfying...\u201d<br>NME<br>",
